  "description": "Pivot point (PP) = (High + Low + Close) / 3 *** First resistance (R1) = (2 x PP) – Low *** First support (S1) = (2 x PP) – High. *** Second resistance (R2) = PP + (High – Low) *** Second support (S2) = PP – (High – Low)  ***  Third resistance (R3) = High + 2(PP – Low) *** \nThird support (S3) = Low – 2(High – PP)   *** S1. S2. R1. R2. Ravi Dahiya.",
  "created_at": "2022-06-17T06:23:56.000000Z",
